   "id": "aroon_trend",
   "name": "Aroon trend",
   "family": "Trend",
   "added_at": "2026-11-08",
   "idea": "Aroon indicator (Tushar Chande, 1995): reads how recently a market made its highest high and lowest low. A recent high with an old low is a young uptrend.",
   "why": "A published trend rule with one parameter that is different from the moving-average, breakout and momentum rules already in the library: it looks at the age of the extremes, not the distance from an average.",
